# SIEM Detection Lab — Active Environment Access Details (Template)

*Template reference for local operator setup. Fill in with your provisioned values.*

---

## 1. Virtual Machine Access

### SIEM Manager VM (`siem-lab-wazuh`)
- **Public IP**: `<SIEM_PUBLIC_IP>` (retrieve via: `terraform output -raw siem_public_ip`)
- **Private IP**: `10.0.1.2`
- **Machine Type**: `e2-standard-2` (2 vCPU, 8 GB RAM, 100 GB SSD)
- **Allowed Management IP**: `<YOUR_PUBLIC_IP>/32`
- **SSH Command**:
  ```bash
  ssh -i ~/.ssh/siem_lab_key ubuntu@<SIEM_PUBLIC_IP>
  ```
- **Wazuh Web Dashboard**:
  - URL: `https://<SIEM_PUBLIC_IP>`
  - **Username**: `admin`
  - **Password**: `<PRINTED_AT_INSTALLATION_OR_IN_WAZUH_PASSWORDS_TXT>`

---

### Honeypot VM (`siem-lab-honeypot`)
- **Public IP**: `<HONEYPOT_PUBLIC_IP>` (retrieve via: `terraform output -raw honeypot_public_ip`)
- **Private IP**: `10.0.1.3`
- **Machine Type**: `e2-micro` (2 vCPU burstable, 1 GB RAM, 30 GB standard PD)
- **SSH Ingress Exposure**: `0.0.0.0/0` (Intentional Honeypot)
- **SSH Command**:
  ```bash
  ssh -i ~/.ssh/siem_lab_key ubuntu@<HONEYPOT_PUBLIC_IP>
  ```

---

## 2. Active Security & Firewall Posture Summary

```
╔══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════╗
║              SIEM Lab — Active Security Posture Summary              ║
╠══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════╣
║ HONEYPOT VM: <HONEYPOT_PUBLIC_IP>                                    ║
║   • INGRESS: TCP 22 → 0.0.0.0/0 (Honeypot target)                    ║
║   • EGRESS:  TCP 1514, 1515 → 10.0.1.0/24 (Wazuh telemetry)         ║
║   • EGRESS:  TCP 80, 443, UDP 53 → 0.0.0.0/0 (Package repositories)  ║
║   • EGRESS:  DENY ALL other outbound traffic (Priority 65534)        ║
╠══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════╣
║ SIEM VM: <SIEM_PUBLIC_IP>                                            ║
║   • INGRESS: TCP 22  → <YOUR_PUBLIC_IP>/32 (Management IP only)      ║
║   • INGRESS: TCP 443 → <YOUR_PUBLIC_IP>/32 (Wazuh Dashboard only)     ║
║   • INGRESS: TCP 1514, 1515 → 10.0.1.3 (Honeypot Agent only)        ║
║   • INGRESS: DENY TCP 9200, 9300 from 0.0.0.0/0 (OpenSearch protected)║
╚══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════╝
```

---

## 3. Operational Quick Reference

```bash
# Obtain all active connection outputs from Terraform:
cd infra/terraform
terraform output

# View live Honeypot SSH authentication attempts:
ssh -i ~/.ssh/siem_lab_key ubuntu@<HONEYPOT_PUBLIC_IP> "sudo tail -f /var/log/auth.log"

# View live normalized Wazuh SIEM alerts:
ssh -i ~/.ssh/siem_lab_key ubuntu@<SIEM_PUBLIC_IP> "sudo tail -f /var/ossec/logs/alerts/alerts.json"

# Import custom OpenSearch Dashboards:
bash wazuh/dashboards/import_dashboards.sh <SIEM_PUBLIC_IP> <WAZUH_PASSWORD>
```
